{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32997","headline":"登岳阳楼有怀寄座主相公 · 曹邺","name":"登岳阳楼有怀寄座主相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南登岳阳楼，北眺长安道。\n不见昇平里，千山树如草。\n骨肉在南楚，沈忧起常早。\n白社愁成空，秋芜待谁扫。\n常闻诗人语，西子不宜老。\n赖识丹元君，时来语蓬岛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}